    "group": "Sorcerer in Terminator Armour",
    "summary": "As your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) begins, you may have one of your army’s **PSYKER** models cast Death Hex. Pick an enemy unit the caster can see within 12″, then roll one D6. A 1 deals D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) to the caster’s unit. On 2+, attacks against the chosen enemy improve their Armour Penetration by 1 until your next [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) begins.",
